<title>CHINA: China to consume 1.1 mln T of copper this year.</title>
<headline>China to consume 1.1 mln T of copper this year.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's consumption of copper was expected to reach 1.1 million tonnes this year, the China Daily said on Tuesday, quoting a report by the Ministry of Internal Trade.</p>
<p>It forecast output of 950,000 tonnes this year.</p>
<p>It gave no more details.</p>
</text>
